@startuml
[*] --> InitialAssessment
InitialAssessment : Conduct initial assessment

state PriorityCategory {
    [*] --> Immediate
    Immediate : Category Red
    Immediate --> VeryUrgent : Signs of life-threatening condition

    VeryUrgent : Category Orange
    VeryUrgent --> Urgent : No immediate threat, but requires quick attention

    Urgent : Category Yellow
    Urgent --> Standard : Stable but requires attention soon

    Standard : Category Green
    Standard --> NonUrgent : Routine problems or minor conditions

    NonUrgent : Category Blue
}

InitialAssessment --> Review
Review : Review clinical data

Review --> PriorityDetermination : Analyze symptoms
PriorityDetermination : Determine clinical priority

PriorityDetermination --> DecisionMaking : Make triage decision based on priority
DecisionMaking : Allocate resources

DecisionMaking --> Reassessment : Continuous monitoring for changes
Reassessment : Re-evaluate priority if patient's condition changes

Reassessment --> PriorityCategory

PriorityDetermination --> PriorityCategory

@enduml